WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.052
Step 1. Open the schedule.

1.2
00:00:02.052 --> 00:00:06.836
The schedule page shows the templates of one month beside a calendar.

1.3
00:00:06.836 --> 00:00:12.813
Select Users, then See Details for the practitioner, then the Availability tab.

2.1
00:00:12.813 --> 00:00:15.722
Step 2. Read the templates of the month.

2.2
00:00:15.722 --> 00:00:20.908
Each card shows the weekdays after Scheduled for, each session with its slots,

2.3
00:00:20.908 --> 00:00:25.796
and the valid period. The lock icon means the template is private.

3.1
00:00:25.796 --> 00:00:27.825
Step 3. Read the calendar.

3.2
00:00:27.825 --> 00:00:33.571
Each coloured dot on a day stands for a template that has a session on that weekday.

3.3
00:00:33.571 --> 00:00:37.149
A striped band marks a day with an exception.

4.1
00:00:37.149 --> 00:00:38.663
Step 4. Open a day.

4.2
00:00:38.663 --> 00:00:43.121
Select a day to open a pop-up with its sessions and its exceptions.

4.3
00:00:43.121 --> 00:00:48.412
If the day has appointments, a link opens them on the appointments page.
